-- src:1035 | Hưởng.
DECLARE `A person who may commit an excluded act` IS ONE OF
    `the insured himself or herself`
    `the second insured`
    `the policyholder in person`
    `a beneficiary of the contract`
    `someone else`

DECLARE `A criminal act` HAS
    `committed by` IS A `A person who may commit an excluded act`
    `unintentional` IS A BOOLEAN

-- One diagnosis claimed under Article 13. What the specialist certifies, measures and
-- dates; the facts the waiting period, the survival period and the Article 19.2 exclusions
-- turn on; and, for 1.19, when a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it.
--  * `the rest of the definition certified as met`: the qualitative part of the annex
--    definition (the specialist, the tests, the clinical picture, and any exclusion in the
--    definition other than a cause listed in `the causes`).
--  * `the qualitative alternative certified`: where the definition offers a qualitative
--    limb IN PLACE OF a number ("hoặc"), whether that limb is certified.
-- src:1006 | a) Ngày mà Người Được Bảo Hiểm được chẩn đoán hoặc điều trị
-- src:1007 | hoặc có bất kỳ dấu hiệu hoặc triệu chứng nào của:
-- src:1008 | (i) Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng giai đoạn sớm, hoặc
-- src:1009 | (ii) Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng giai đoạn giữa, hoặc
-- src:1010 | (iii) Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng giai đoạn cuối, hoặc
-- src:1011 | (iv) Bệnh lý Nghiêm Trọng Bổ Sung.
-- src:1012 | sau chín mươi (90) ngày kể từ Ngày Cấp Hợp Đồng hoặc
-- src:1013 | ngày khôi phục hiệu lực Hợp Đồng gần nhất, tùy thuộc vào
-- src:1014 | ngày nào đến sau; và
-- src:1015 | b) Người Được Bảo Hiểm vẫn còn sống ít nhất là ba mươi (30)
-- src:1016 | ngày kể từ ngày Người Được Bảo Hiểm được chẩn đoán mắc
-- src:1017 | bất kỳ Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng hoặc bệnh lý theo giới tính
-- src:1018 | nào.
DECLARE `A diagnosis` HAS
    `the condition`                                          IS A `A listed condition`
    `the person diagnosed`                                   IS A `A person diagnosed`
    `date of diagnosis`                                      IS A DATE
    `date of the first sign, symptom, diagnosis or treatment` IS A DATE
    `the visit`                                              IS A NUMBER
    `the paired organ`                                       IS A MAYBE `A paired organ`
    `the accident causing it`                                IS A MAYBE `An accident`
    `the measurements`                                       IS A LIST OF `A measurement`
    `the activities of daily living the insured cannot perform` IS A LIST OF `An activity of daily living`
    `the qualitative alternative certified`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the rest of the definition certified as met`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the causes`                                             IS A LIST OF `A cause`
    `date a doctor first examined, diagnosed or treated it`  IS A DATE
    `declared and accepted by the Company`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `suicide, an act of suicide or a self-inflicted injury`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `a criminal act causing it`                              IS A MAYBE `A criminal act`
    `nuclear, chemical or radioactive cause`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of death of the insured`                           IS A MAYBE DATE

-- A benefit under Article 13 already paid (or approved) under this contract. Whether an
-- earlier payment was "for the same illness" ("cho cùng một bệnh", 13.2(a), 13.3(a)) is
-- taken as a fact the Company's claim record states: the document gives no test for it
-- (NOTES.md, finding X-4).
DECLARE `A critical illness benefit already paid` HAS
    `the condition`                    IS A `A listed condition`
    `the amount`                       IS A NUMBER
    `date of diagnosis`                IS A DATE
    `the visit`                        IS A NUMBER
    `the paired organ`                 IS A MAYBE `A paired organ`
    `for the same illness as the claim` IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the Company approved it`     IS A DATE

-- A claim under Article 13: the diagnosis, and what the Company's records show at its date.
--  * `the conditions claimed under the contract`: every condition claimed under this
--    contract at any time, this claim included, paid or not (the bars of src:1556-1559,
--    2090-2095 and 2105-2108 turn on a claim being made, not paid).
--  * `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts`: 13.1(a) and 13.2(a)
--    cap the total across contracts and riders for one payment.
--  * `date the claim is decided`: the day the claim is considered, which the 30-day survival
--    period of 18(b) is measured against while the insured lives.
DECLARE `A critical illness claim` HAS
    `the contract`                                         IS A `The contract`
    `the diagnosis`                                        IS A `A diagnosis`
    `sum insured at the date of diagnosis`                 IS A NUMBER
    `the contract in force at the date of diagnosis`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the benefits already paid`                            IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
    `the conditions claimed under the contract`            IS A LIST OF `A listed condition`
    `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts` IS A NUMBER
    `date the Company approved the comfort cash coupon`     IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the claim is decided`                            IS A DATE

§§ `Articles 12 and 19.1 — a death`

-- What caused the death, as far as Article 19.1 asks.
